<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy" description="How Enfield Zimbabwe handles personal information submitted through this website."><PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy policy" intro="This draft explains how website enquiry data is handled. It should be reviewed by Enfield’s legal adviser before publication." /><section class="section"><div class="container legal prose"><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>When you contact us, we may collect your name, organisation, email address, telephone number, product interest and message. Basic technical logs may also be processed to operate and secure the website.</p><h2>How we use it</h2><p>We use enquiry information to respond, prepare quotations, maintain business correspondence and protect the website from misuse. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Service providers and retention</h2><p>Hosting, security and email providers may process limited information on our behalf. We retain information only as long as reasonably required for the enquiry, legal obligations and legitimate business records.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may ask about the personal information we hold or request correction where appropriate. Contact <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a>.</p><p class="legal-note">Draft placeholder — obtain Zimbabwe-specific legal review before production use.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
